                        "review": "My favorite game of all time...\n\nThousands upon thousands of hours spent in PvP, doing challenge runs, and helping others.\n\n(Since the servers have shut down again, and this time it might be forever, here's a quick PvP ranking: 1. DS2, 2. DS3, 3. DS1, 4. Elden Ring, 5. Bloodborne.)\n\nFrom the music and combat system to the world itself, everything about this game is perfect to me. Even though a lot of people hate on DS2, this game is magical, special, and unforgettable.\n\nI still remember almost every moment I experienced while playing this game. It was truly a wonderful experience.\n\nFavorite game/10",
